(4438111, 639487, 25728, '<td valign="top">LOL, I have enough tattoos that just seeing this photo immediately brought the smell of it to my mind! I love this stuff!</td>', 'LOL, I have enough tattoos that just seeing this photo immediately brought the smell of it to my mind! I love this stuff!', '2008-01-30 00:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
