(4438652, 640066, 86799, '<td valign="top">Subject is a little vague.  The eye is led all around, but nothing really grabs the attention, IMO.</td>', 'Subject is a little vague.  The eye is led all around, but nothing really grabs the attention, IMO.', '2008-01-30 06:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438670, 639604, 86799, '<td valign="top">Intersting concept, well executed.  Nicely rich.  Not sure about the star chart idea, but it works pretty well.</td>', 'Intersting concept, well executed.  Nicely rich.  Not sure about the star chart idea, but it works pretty well.', '2008-01-30 06:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438676, 639483, 86799, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but really needs some sharpness in the works.  The motion is good, but needs to be surrounded by crisp detail.</td>', 'Good idea, but really needs some sharpness in the works.  The motion is good, but needs to be surrounded by crisp detail.', '2008-01-30 06:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438683, 639979, 86799, '<td valign="top">Needs some fire and smoke to be convincing.</td>', 'Needs some fire and smoke to be convincing.', '2008-01-30 06:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438702, 637421, 87808, '<td valign="top">I think if there had been some brightly coloured spices in here, it would have popped a little more.  Or maybe a different background colour.  Love the nostalgia though 7</td>', 'I think if there had been some brightly coloured spices in here, it would have popped a little more.  Or maybe a different background colour.  Love the nostalgia though 7', '2008-01-30 06:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438705, 639679, 87808, '<td valign="top">It is a nice picture, is the hangy down thing an old streetlamp?  Very interesting though.</td>', 'It is a nice picture, is the hangy down thing an old streetlamp?  Very interesting though.', '2008-01-30 06:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438707, 639469, 87808, '<td valign="top">Nice warm colours on this one.  WOuld love to have seen just the fishing nets as the street lamp sort of draws your eye to it.  Nice capture</td>', 'Nice warm colours on this one.  WOuld love to have seen just the fishing nets as the street lamp sort of draws your eye to it.  Nice capture', '2008-01-30 06:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438712, 637851, 87808, '<td valign="top">Love the crispness and clean colours in this shot.  The fact that he has training shoes on negates the nostalgia which I think adds to this shot.  9</td>', 'Love the crispness and clean colours in this shot.  The fact that he has training shoes on negates the nostalgia which I think adds to this shot.  9', '2008-01-30 06:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438715, 638429, 87808, '<td valign="top">Very old tradition that you have captured very well. love the black and white it is very crisp.  the details stand out. 9 (the border is killing me)</td>', 'Very old tradition that you have captured very well. love the black and white it is very crisp.  the details stand out. 9 (the border is killing me)', '2008-01-30 06:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438717, 639926, 87808, '<td valign="top">Love the warm colours in this one, it just invites you to walk down this lane.  8</td>', 'Love the warm colours in this one, it just invites you to walk down this lane.  8', '2008-01-30 06:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438722, 639423, 87808, '<td valign="top">It would appear as though there are some bones holding up the skates.  Such a shame that this is so small, but the colours are good and it is in focus.</td>', 'It would appear as though there are some bones holding up the skates.  Such a shame that this is so small, but the colours are good and it is in focus.', '2008-01-30 06:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438729, 640003, 87808, '<td valign="top">How wonderful to look at, I like the angle on this one, the blues and gold certainly pop out.  The intricate details in the carvings grab your attention.  For myself would have liked to seen all the lights cropped out, this way the eye is not drawn to them, but you still have that fantastic angle and frame 9</td>', 'How wonderful to look at, I like the angle on this one, the blues and gold certainly pop out.  The intricate details in the carvings grab your attention.  For myself would have liked to seen all the lights cropped out, this way the eye is not drawn to them, but you still have that fantastic angle and frame 9', '2008-01-30 06:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438733, 640064, 87808, '<td valign="top">Amazing how there is no snow on the ground, the snowman used it all up!  Lovely childhood memory, well done</td>', 'Amazing how there is no snow on the ground, the snowman used it all up!  Lovely childhood memory, well done', '2008-01-30 06:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438735, 639356, 87808, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours on this one and the focus is spot on.  your eyes are immediatly drawn to the car.  Can not see much rust on it though 9</td>', 'Lovely colours on this one and the focus is spot on.  your eyes are immediatly drawn to the car.  Can not see much rust on it though 9', '2008-01-30 06:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438739, 639782, 87808, '<td valign="top">I love the old wood stove in the corner there, it does take a few moments to adjust from the bright light of the window.  very nostalgic. Maybe if the centered chair was on the side, it would make it a little more flowing 9</td>', 'I love the old wood stove in the corner there, it does take a few moments to adjust from the bright light of the window.  very nostalgic. Maybe if the centered chair was on the side, it would make it a little more flowing 9', '2008-01-30 06:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438744, 639919, 87808, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous old car in wonderful condition, someone has taken care of this baby.  The split windscreen screams nostalgia.  Crisp and clean, good lighting, well done 9</td>', 'What a fabulous old car in wonderful condition, someone has taken care of this baby.  The split windscreen screams nostalgia.  Crisp and clean, good lighting, well done 9', '2008-01-30 06:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438745, 639899, 89465, '<td valign="top">Good color and saturation, I like the shadoiwing as well</td>', 'Good color and saturation, I like the shadoiwing as well', '2008-01-30 06:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438748, 639871, 87808, '<td valign="top">I think that the title does not give anything to this great shot.  Love the clarity of the cobbled lane and brick work.  The black and white of this image is good, lots of different blacks and white, not your bog standard flat bw.</td>', 'I think that the title does not give anything to this great shot.  Love the clarity of the cobbled lane and brick work.  The black and white of this image is good, lots of different blacks and white, not your bog standard flat bw.', '2008-01-30 06:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438754, 639604, 87808, '<td valign="top">A nice shot here, the title says it all.  The whole image sings about nostalgia.  Just not sue about the picture frame.  I think it would have been a more dramit shot if it was sideways or not in there at all and the items spread about.  The feather would have been extremely dramitic if it had been standing up, would have lent softness to hard lines of the papers.  Well done</td>', 'A nice shot here, the title says it all.  The whole image sings about nostalgia.  Just not sue about the picture frame.  I think it would have been a more dramit shot if it was sideways or not in there at all and the items spread about.  The feather would have been extremely dramitic if it had been standing up, would have lent softness to hard lines of the papers.  Well done', '2008-01-30 06:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
