(4439677, 639859, 85886, '<td valign="top">Lovely simple interpretation and nice execution.  If I''m being nitpicky I''d suggest that the handwriting itself could be a bit more ''olde world'' and perhaps elaborate to enhance the old ways feel a bit.</td>', 'Lovely simple interpretation and nice execution.  If I''m being nitpicky I''d suggest that the handwriting itself could be a bit more ''olde world'' and perhaps elaborate to enhance the old ways feel a bit.', '2008-01-30 11:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439680, 639999, 12316, '<td valign="top">Shoudn''t be there more light on the object? ... I think it would have made a diference ... just my opinion ...</td>', 'Shoudn''t be there more light on the object? ... I think it would have made a diference ... just my opinion ...', '2008-01-30 11:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439682, 640041, 85886, '<td valign="top">Yeah baby...good ole tri-x with grain you could build sandcastles out of.  Unfortunately I don''t think digital grain comes across as well, but I get your intention.  Very Lennon/Ono shot imho - I think I''d like this ungrained and lovely on my wall.</td>', 'Yeah baby...good ole tri-x with grain you could build sandcastles out of.  Unfortunately I don''t think digital grain comes across as well, but I get your intention.  Very Lennon/Ono shot imho - I think I''d like this ungrained and lovely on my wall.', '2008-01-30 11:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439685, 639788, 85886, '<td valign="top">Personally I don''t like the high colour border with the black and white - it''s just too distracting.  The shot itself provides lots of interest but isn''t ''old ways'' explicitly enough to score higher.</td>', 'Personally I don''t like the high colour border with the black and white - it''s just too distracting.  The shot itself provides lots of interest but isn''t ''old ways'' explicitly enough to score higher.', '2008-01-30 11:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439689, 639732, 85886, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - I really like the b&amp;w/duotone conversion you''ve done on this because it really brings out the various tones.  The DoF is great, pushing out the background enough to keep focus on the tricycle - and your subject has an interesting look on his sharp face.  Nice.</td>', 'Lovely shot - I really like the b&w/duotone conversion you''ve done on this because it really brings out the various tones.  The DoF is great, pushing out the background enough to keep focus on the tricycle - and your subject has an interesting look on his sharp face.  Nice.', '2008-01-30 11:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439690, 637830, 85886, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but would I think have better impact if you had greater DoF to bring the whiskey into focus.</td>', 'Nice shot, but would I think have better impact if you had greater DoF to bring the whiskey into focus.', '2008-01-30 11:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439696, 640062, 85886, '<td valign="top">What''s an HMO?!  I love the low contrast in this shot which shows off the textures and shapes so nicely with the subtle lighting.  The mortal and pestle definitely ties this together as an ''Old Ways'' shot.</td>', 'What''s an HMO?!  I love the low contrast in this shot which shows off the textures and shapes so nicely with the subtle lighting.  The mortal and pestle definitely ties this together as an ''Old Ways'' shot.', '2008-01-30 11:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439702, 640038, 85886, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous toning that really makes this shot.  Everything feels ''wartime'' about this shot (as you no doubt intended) with great cues everywhere, from the key, to the stamps, to the photo and even to the handwriting.  Technically the DoF, lighting, composition and tones are all perfect for the shot imho.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Gorgeous toning that really makes this shot.  Everything feels ''wartime'' about this shot (as you no doubt intended) with great cues everywhere, from the key, to the stamps, to the photo and even to the handwriting.  Technically the DoF, lighting, composition and tones are all perfect for the shot imho.  Excellent work.', '2008-01-30 11:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439706, 639901, 85886, '<td valign="top">Outstanding simplicity and lovely use of light and shadow.  The fact that the timer is spotless and pin sharp is really impressive in a Basic challenge (I never have that kind of patience!) and makes the shot.</td>', 'Outstanding simplicity and lovely use of light and shadow.  The fact that the timer is spotless and pin sharp is really impressive in a Basic challenge (I never have that kind of patience!) and makes the shot.', '2008-01-30 11:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439719, 639487, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great title - I don''t think I''d have spent the time looking at the uses on the side but with the title it really diverted attention.  Would have been a nicer shot if you could have kept a clean background as those tiles are a tad in the way, and the texture of the goop itself could be brought out better with a bit more DoF (if sharper you may well win more points for the ''ooo shiny'' factor)</td>', 'Great title - I don''t think I''d have spent the time looking at the uses on the side but with the title it really diverted attention.  Would have been a nicer shot if you could have kept a clean background as those tiles are a tad in the way, and the texture of the goop itself could be brought out better with a bit more DoF (if sharper you may well win more points for the ''ooo shiny'' factor)', '2008-01-30 11:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439728, 639871, 85886, '<td valign="top">Beautiful candid.  The b&amp;w really works, contrasting the brickwork with the white plaster.  The backlight from the sun also really makes a big impact on the lovely older couple, both in the lighting on his jacket but the shadows on the floor.  I don''t know how you feel about borders but I think a small border would really help frame this lovely shot.</td>', 'Beautiful candid.  The b&w really works, contrasting the brickwork with the white plaster.  The backlight from the sun also really makes a big impact on the lovely older couple, both in the lighting on his jacket but the shadows on the floor.  I don''t know how you feel about borders but I think a small border would really help frame this lovely shot.', '2008-01-30 11:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439733, 639640, 85886, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea, and really interesting subject - but unfortunately it needs to be in focus for maximum impact.</td>', 'Lovely idea, and really interesting subject - but unfortunately it needs to be in focus for maximum impact.', '2008-01-30 11:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439735, 639704, 86799, '<td valign="top">Nice, but a little more DOF would help, I think.  Good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Nice, but a little more DOF would help, I think.  Good take on the challenge.', '2008-01-30 11:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439748, 638044, 85886, '<td valign="top">Lomo love forever!  (you can keep the film!!).  Nice shot and way more innovative than other ''film is old'' shots.  I think the film itself could benefit from being sharper though.</td>', 'Lomo love forever!  (you can keep the film!!).  Nice shot and way more innovative than other ''film is old'' shots.  I think the film itself could benefit from being sharper though.', '2008-01-30 11:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439752, 639423, 85886, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame the image is so small when you''ve got 640 to play with because I really like the image of the roller skate with the foot skeleton, but the size lessens the impact.</td>', 'It''s a shame the image is so small when you''ve got 640 to play with because I really like the image of the roller skate with the foot skeleton, but the size lessens the impact.', '2008-01-30 11:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439756, 637753, 85886, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed shot.  Feels fisheyed, which really adds to the perspective.  I''m not a big fan of the toning - the toning adds to the old factor but is just a tad too strong imho.</td>', 'Beautifully composed shot.  Feels fisheyed, which really adds to the perspective.  I''m not a big fan of the toning - the toning adds to the old factor but is just a tad too strong imho.', '2008-01-30 11:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439764, 639968, 85886, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but there''s no real focal point here, so more DoF would bring out the works more as there''s so much interest there.</td>', 'Nice idea but there''s no real focal point here, so more DoF would bring out the works more as there''s so much interest there.', '2008-01-30 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439773, 639667, 87093, '<td valign="top">Very old and nice</td>', 'Very old and nice', '2008-01-30 11:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
