(4439805, 639793, 87093, '<td valign="top">Good old looking picture</td>', 'Good old looking picture', '2008-01-30 11:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439810, 639494, 85886, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  Her expression is priceless and really conveys ''where the heck does this go?''.  The composition is great but the post production (or apparent lack thereof) lets it down.  With a little work on the contrast, grain and levels I think this photo could really stand out.</td>', 'I love this shot.  Her expression is priceless and really conveys ''where the heck does this go?''.  The composition is great but the post production (or apparent lack thereof) lets it down.  With a little work on the contrast, grain and levels I think this photo could really stand out.', '2008-01-30 11:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439813, 639859, 87093, '<td valign="top">Good hand writing and nice shot</td>', 'Good hand writing and nice shot', '2008-01-30 12:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439814, 639423, 12316, '<td valign="top">Isn''t there another image in this contest which has the same theme? It''s called "Skatebones" ... I''m sure you know it :)</td>', 'Isn''t there another image in this contest which has the same theme? It''s called "Skatebones" ... I''m sure you know it :)', '2008-01-30 12:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439819, 639583, 85886, '<td valign="top">Errrr...good luck with this one!  Are you troll baiting, or is this a genuine entry because I''m confused.  Surely you know that the presumed subject ''hash browns'' are totally out of focus and unrecognisable.  Even if you knew that, this doesn''t seem very Old Ways either.  Or maybe this is your proudest shot ever and I''m missing the point.  Yours in a totally-lost-but-trying-to-be-constructive way, Quasi ;)</td>', 'Errrr...good luck with this one!  Are you troll baiting, or is this a genuine entry because I''m confused.  Surely you know that the presumed subject ''hash browns'' are totally out of focus and unrecognisable.  Even if you knew that, this doesn''t seem very Old Ways either.  Or maybe this is your proudest shot ever and I''m missing the point.  Yours in a totally-lost-but-trying-to-be-constructive way, Quasi ;)', '2008-01-30 12:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439836, 639641, 85886, '<td valign="top">Didn''t I just see a shot of this very same cello body elsewhere in this challenge?</td>', 'Didn''t I just see a shot of this very same cello body elsewhere in this challenge?', '2008-01-30 12:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439868, 639737, 85886, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous shot but I really don''t want to sound like a DNMC hater but this really does feel like a shoehorn.  Maybe I don''t spend enough time in the kitchen but doesn''t everyone still use a wire whisk to beat eggs?!  It just doesn''t feel like ''old ways'' enough to me.  It''s a great image and it''s hard to mark you down for it, but I have to do a -1 out of respect to all the others that seem better interpreted imho  Brilliant shot in every other respect.</td>', 'This is a fabulous shot but I really don''t want to sound like a DNMC hater but this really does feel like a shoehorn.  Maybe I don''t spend enough time in the kitchen but doesn''t everyone still use a wire whisk to beat eggs?!  It just doesn''t feel like ''old ways'' enough to me.  It''s a great image and it''s hard to mark you down for it, but I have to do a -1 out of respect to all the others that seem better interpreted imho  Brilliant shot in every other respect.', '2008-01-30 12:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439895, 640015, 70888, '<td valign="top">wow,awesome lighting an clarity-10,ive got an old 230 ,lol</td>', 'wow,awesome lighting an clarity-10,ive got an old 230 ,lol', '2008-01-30 12:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439932, 639484, 88580, '<td valign="top">I used to scavenge parts from old electronics when I was a kid.  Looking at this photo, I can still smell the characteristic smell.</td>', 'I used to scavenge parts from old electronics when I was a kid.  Looking at this photo, I can still smell the characteristic smell.', '2008-01-30 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439945, 638931, 83375, '<td valign="top">Ha, saw this on another site, and I''m glad you went with the color version. The blue really pops, and the lighting is very good.</td>', 'Ha, saw this on another site, and I''m glad you went with the color version. The blue really pops, and the lighting is very good.', '2008-01-30 12:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
