(4442595, 638321, 71526, '<td valign="top">I made a similar shot but did not send it ''cos it had no "WOW effect" since its lack of "inner power with fire"... Yours is much better, and i will vote 8 ''cos the perfect execution and er... well... you know.... great idea! :)<br/> <br/>Just a small critique: i think the lower part of the shirt is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I made a similar shot but did not send it ''cos it had no "WOW effect" since its lack of "inner power with fire"... Yours is much better, and i will vote 8 ''cos the perfect execution and er... well... you know.... great idea! :) Just a small critique: i think the lower part of the shirt is a bit distracting.', '2008-01-31 06:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442602, 639911, 71526, '<td valign="top">beautiful girl, specially her eyes... and we now have an Eyes challenge! Bad luck you take this shot a few days before its time, but well, we don''t have a crystal ball, righ? Anyway i think it is a bit "off topic" so i''m voting 4... BTW: I think you have a typo in your title: guiltless?</td>', 'beautiful girl, specially her eyes... and we now have an Eyes challenge! Bad luck you take this shot a few days before its time, but well, we don''t have a crystal ball, righ? Anyway i think it is a bit "off topic" so i''m voting 4... BTW: I think you have a typo in your title: guiltless?', '2008-01-31 07:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
