(4442650, 640062, 71526, '<td valign="top">HMO? According to wikipedia:<br/>HMO can mean the following:<br/>    * Health maintenance organization<br/>    * Airport code for the General Ignacio Pesqueira Garcia International Airport in Hermosillo, Mexico<br/>    * Houses in multiple occupation<br/>    * Home Media Option (Tivo)<br/>    * Hermanus Magnetic Observatory in Hermanus, South Africa<br/>    * Hückel method, a very simple LCAO MO Method<br/>    * Harvest Moon Online, an online farming simulation game<br/> <br/>Don''t get your title... Voting 6 ''cos i like the image, great light!</td>', 'HMO? According to wikipedia:HMO can mean the following:    * Health maintenance organization    * Airport code for the General Ignacio Pesqueira Garcia International Airport in Hermosillo, Mexico    * Houses in multiple occupation    * Home Media Option (Tivo)    * Hermanus Magnetic Observatory in Hermanus, South Africa    * Hückel method, a very simple LCAO MO Method    * Harvest Moon Online, an online farming simulation game Don''t get your title... Voting 6 ''cos i like the image, great light!', '2008-01-31 07:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
