(4442802, 639565, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely green colours - just seems a little overprocessed somehow which lightly spoils what for me could have been a great entry. A lower viewpoint at about the grass height level, with some blurred blades in the foreground would have allow you a) to see more of the face, b) opened up the background c) added more interest for not being at "normal height" - the viewpoint in which we probably view the world most of the time anyway</td>', 'Lovely green colours - just seems a little overprocessed somehow which lightly spoils what for me could have been a great entry. A lower viewpoint at about the grass height level, with some blurred blades in the foreground would have allow you a) to see more of the face, b) opened up the background c) added more interest for not being at "normal height" - the viewpoint in which we probably view the world most of the time anyway', '2008-01-31 08:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
