(4442988, 640069, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot but with all the trees there is a lot of distraction from your subject.  Using a color shot, even if de-saturated would have decreased the density and, therefor, made the trees less distracting.<br/> <br/>All said, however, it''s still a very nice shot.</td>', 'This is a cool shot but with all the trees there is a lot of distraction from your subject.  Using a color shot, even if de-saturated would have decreased the density and, therefor, made the trees less distracting. All said, however, it''s still a very nice shot.', '2008-01-31 09:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
