(4443183, 639378, 72318, '<td valign="top">wonder how many bible bashers will crit this / vote low? :) Nice shot - could be a tad brighter in the midtones, but apart from that a strong entry.</td>', 'wonder how many bible bashers will crit this / vote low? :) Nice shot - could be a tad brighter in the midtones, but apart from that a strong entry.', '2008-01-31 11:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443185, 638229, 72318, '<td valign="top">lol - mmhrmmm? love the contrast with the shaded background - picks him out nicely. Not sure if he could do a roundhouse kick tho...</td>', 'lol - mmhrmmm? love the contrast with the shaded background - picks him out nicely. Not sure if he could do a roundhouse kick tho...', '2008-01-31 11:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443190, 638056, 72318, '<td valign="top">almost a pun on stock photography.  nice job - i''m sure advanced editing could make this into one hell of an image :)</td>', 'almost a pun on stock photography.  nice job - i''m sure advanced editing could make this into one hell of an image :)', '2008-01-31 11:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443193, 638635, 72318, '<td valign="top">nice idea - not sure about the composition tho, something just doesnt work and i cant put my finger one it.</td>', 'nice idea - not sure about the composition tho, something just doesnt work and i cant put my finger one it.', '2008-01-31 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443208, 639128, 86799, '<td valign="top">A bit much on the saturation, maybe.</td>', 'A bit much on the saturation, maybe.', '2008-01-31 11:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443209, 639320, 88352, '<td valign="top">Very neat weaving, I think this could have improved by getting his whole body into the frame.</td>', 'Very neat weaving, I think this could have improved by getting his whole body into the frame.', '2008-01-31 11:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443212, 637851, 88352, '<td valign="top">Nice tennis shoes!  hahaha... Still love this one, the colors and contrast are great and really make the photo "pop".</td>', 'Nice tennis shoes!  hahaha... Still love this one, the colors and contrast are great and really make the photo "pop".', '2008-01-31 11:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443214, 639901, 88352, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow cast, there are some blown-out spots cast by the lighting.</td>', 'I like the shadow cast, there are some blown-out spots cast by the lighting.', '2008-01-31 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443218, 639916, 88352, '<td valign="top">I understand trying to go for an interesting composition, but I think the tree on the right side is a distraction from the main subject.</td>', 'I understand trying to go for an interesting composition, but I think the tree on the right side is a distraction from the main subject.', '2008-01-31 11:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443219, 639697, 88352, '<td valign="top">Very cool lighting effect, I like the composition as well.</td>', 'Very cool lighting effect, I like the composition as well.', '2008-01-31 11:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443232, 640038, 88352, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tone to this, the only thing bugging me is that the person here is writing a letter to Jayne, but is looking at a photo of a man?  It may be that he''s sending the photo, but as-is it is odd.  Still a high score on my end.</td>', 'I like the sepia tone to this, the only thing bugging me is that the person here is writing a letter to Jayne, but is looking at a photo of a man?  It may be that he''s sending the photo, but as-is it is odd.  Still a high score on my end.', '2008-01-31 11:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443238, 638814, 88352, '<td valign="top">Love the bruised finger.  Dirtier hands would have really done this for me.</td>', 'Love the bruised finger.  Dirtier hands would have really done this for me.', '2008-01-31 11:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443241, 639911, 88352, '<td valign="top">Looked at this for a while, tried to take the title into context, and I''m still not coming up with an "old ways" theme.  Very cute child, nice composition.</td>', 'Looked at this for a while, tried to take the title into context, and I''m still not coming up with an "old ways" theme.  Very cute child, nice composition.', '2008-01-31 11:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443244, 639416, 88352, '<td valign="top">A lot of stuff, but no real focal point.</td>', 'A lot of stuff, but no real focal point.', '2008-01-31 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443247, 639469, 88352, '<td valign="top">Seems to be tilted, and that may be what you were going for, but it''s just making me dizzy!</td>', 'Seems to be tilted, and that may be what you were going for, but it''s just making me dizzy!', '2008-01-31 11:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443253, 640003, 88352, '<td valign="top">I actually like the tilting used here, it makes this shot a lot more interesting, and the lights along the edge lined up with frame are great.</td>', 'I actually like the tilting used here, it makes this shot a lot more interesting, and the lights along the edge lined up with frame are great.', '2008-01-31 11:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443256, 637203, 88352, '<td valign="top">Um, ow.  Wish I knew what the title meant.</td>', 'Um, ow.  Wish I knew what the title meant.', '2008-01-31 11:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443260, 639423, 88352, '<td valign="top">What''s on the left side?  I wish this photo was larger so we could see more detail.</td>', 'What''s on the left side?  I wish this photo was larger so we could see more detail.', '2008-01-31 11:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443265, 638593, 88352, '<td valign="top">Hahaha!  Love the title with this, it puts it in perspective.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Hahaha!  Love the title with this, it puts it in perspective.  Nicely done.', '2008-01-31 11:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443268, 639502, 88352, '<td valign="top">Hahaha!  Great expressions, love the lighting.</td>', 'Hahaha!  Great expressions, love the lighting.', '2008-01-31 11:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443273, 639641, 88352, '<td valign="top">The flower seems to be out of focus</td>', 'The flower seems to be out of focus', '2008-01-31 11:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
