(4443616, 640038, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Not only does this show old ways but it evokes emotion around connecting with the soldier. Composition is well laid out to draw the eye to the soldier, along with showing the action of writing the letter. The stamps and key give it a timeless or historical feel. Black and white make it timeless. Desk is a nice dark back drop that looks very "real" to the situation. One of the reasons I like this is because it looks like you captured something real in action, not just a pure setup for this challenge as so many others have done (including myself). The more I look the more I love it! The one thing that might have added is if it were lit by candle light. That would enhance the timeless feel and give it softer light.</td>', 'Great shot! Not only does this show old ways but it evokes emotion around connecting with the soldier. Composition is well laid out to draw the eye to the soldier, along with showing the action of writing the letter. The stamps and key give it a timeless or historical feel. Black and white make it timeless. Desk is a nice dark back drop that looks very "real" to the situation. One of the reasons I like this is because it looks like you captured something real in action, not just a pure setup for this challenge as so many others have done (including myself). The more I look the more I love it! The one thing that might have added is if it were lit by candle light. That would enhance the timeless feel and give it softer light.', '2008-01-31 13:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443620, 640015, 88204, '<td valign="top">Definitely old. I think I''d like it better if there was a little more atmosphere around it rather than just a pure white background. It works but an old desk may have made it look more real instead of set up for this challenge.</td>', 'Definitely old. I think I''d like it better if there was a little more atmosphere around it rather than just a pure white background. It works but an old desk may have made it look more real instead of set up for this challenge.', '2008-01-31 13:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443622, 639859, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the close up. Black and white is beautiful and simple. Very nice!</td>', 'I love the close up. Black and white is beautiful and simple. Very nice!', '2008-01-31 13:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443625, 640064, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice composition although it doesn''t really evoke "old ways" for me.</td>', 'Nice composition although it doesn''t really evoke "old ways" for me.', '2008-01-31 13:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443627, 640016, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great contrast. Black and white works well. Borders are nice to set it off. I might have liked something out of focus to simplify the overall image a bit.</td>', 'Great contrast. Black and white works well. Borders are nice to set it off. I might have liked something out of focus to simplify the overall image a bit.', '2008-01-31 13:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
