(4443632, 639732, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The VW in the background emphasizes old ways as well. Black and white works very well for this image.</td>', 'Great shot. The VW in the background emphasizes old ways as well. Black and white works very well for this image.', '2008-01-31 13:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
