(4446294, 640062, 811, '<td valign="top">That is really a neat idea.  I also the lighting you have used.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'That is really a neat idea.  I also the lighting you have used.  Very nicely done.', '2008-02-01 10:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446304, 638898, 811, '<td valign="top">Looks vast.  I like the coloring on this.  Gives it a feeling of desolation, I think.</td>', 'Looks vast.  I like the coloring on this.  Gives it a feeling of desolation, I think.', '2008-02-01 10:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446368, 638757, 79335, '<td valign="top">i love the treatment! very nice! 7</td>', 'i love the treatment! very nice! 7', '2008-02-01 11:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446453, 640041, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like the tight crop and the grain/noise in this.</td>', 'I like the tight crop and the grain/noise in this.', '2008-02-01 11:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446466, 639487, 6519, '<td valign="top">Good subject, certainly on topic.<br/>However, the photo would look better if you had taken more care with your background. A large piece of white paper curved upward behind the tin would have given you a smooth backdrop. As it is, I keep looking at the upper left hand corner trying to work out what I''m looking at.</td>', 'Good subject, certainly on topic.However, the photo would look better if you had taken more care with your background. A large piece of white paper curved upward behind the tin would have given you a smooth backdrop. As it is, I keep looking at the upper left hand corner trying to work out what I''m looking at.', '2008-02-01 11:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446477, 639483, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m not too sure about the color and lighting, but I like the interesting crop.</td>', 'I''m not too sure about the color and lighting, but I like the interesting crop.', '2008-02-01 11:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446492, 639697, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the overly yellow color cast (I just checked how it would look without that and found it way better), but I like the subject and the composition. Nice little setup.</td>', 'I don''t care for the overly yellow color cast (I just checked how it would look without that and found it way better), but I like the subject and the composition. Nice little setup.', '2008-02-01 11:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446504, 639655, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this image - what is the reason for all the mirrors? <br/>I feel overwhelmed by all that busyness.</td>', 'I don''t understand this image - what is the reason for all the mirrors? I feel overwhelmed by all that busyness.', '2008-02-01 11:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446555, 637787, 6519, '<td valign="top">What I like: the fabulous old building !!!!<br/>What I don''t like: the strong color cast and the lean. Plus I keep wondering what the very top of it looks like.</td>', 'What I like: the fabulous old building !!!!What I don''t like: the strong color cast and the lean. Plus I keep wondering what the very top of it looks like.', '2008-02-01 11:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446651, 639697, 55892, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but even though the message is not having light, you need more light to illustrate the subject.</td>', 'Good concept, but even though the message is not having light, you need more light to illustrate the subject.', '2008-02-01 12:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446664, 638045, 55892, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  The leaning over phone lines in the background adds to the effect.</td>', 'Great colors.  The leaning over phone lines in the background adds to the effect.', '2008-02-01 12:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446695, 638771, 55892, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to hold my nose! Good color for theme. The trees hovering overhead makes the picture scary;  I wouldn''t like to go there out in the dark.  Although the shadows are essential to the theme, I think  it would look better without the shadow in the right foreground.</td>', 'Makes me want to hold my nose! Good color for theme. The trees hovering overhead makes the picture scary;  I wouldn''t like to go there out in the dark.  Although the shadows are essential to the theme, I think  it would look better without the shadow in the right foreground.', '2008-02-01 12:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446765, 639999, 83650, '<td valign="top">I liked this one as soon as I saw it, but....the other thing that catches my eye right off the bat is it seems that it''s tilted in the frame.  Possibly a .5-1 degree rotate to the left would have fixed that.</td>', 'I liked this one as soon as I saw it, but....the other thing that catches my eye right off the bat is it seems that it''s tilted in the frame.  Possibly a .5-1 degree rotate to the left would have fixed that.', '2008-02-01 13:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446773, 638044, 83650, '<td valign="top">Couple things on the lighting - I think the shadows from the film looks great(it''s cool to see the advancing holes as shadows), it''s just cast from the camera makes it seem a bit harsh.  Still a good idea though.</td>', 'Couple things on the lighting - I think the shadows from the film looks great(it''s cool to see the advancing holes as shadows), it''s just cast from the camera makes it seem a bit harsh.  Still a good idea though.', '2008-02-01 13:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446873, 639797, 33672, '<td valign="top">Building looks really metallic. I do like the leading lines and the sky. Comp makes it an interesting view.</td>', 'Building looks really metallic. I do like the leading lines and the sky. Comp makes it an interesting view.', '2008-02-01 13:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447262, 639378, 89333, '<td valign="top">I quite like the sentiment and the overall idea. I think the book needs to be <i>much</i> larger to be effective. I happen to recognize it, but wouldn''t know what it was otherwise. Also, the image looks a bit dark, but I realize more exposure would have blown the white accents. Maybe you could increase the midtones a bit.</td>', 'I quite like the sentiment and the overall idea. I think the book needs to be much larger to be effective. I happen to recognize it, but wouldn''t know what it was otherwise. Also, the image looks a bit dark, but I realize more exposure would have blown the white accents. Maybe you could increase the midtones a bit.', '2008-02-01 14:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447291, 639437, 89333, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is excellent. I think the image would have been more effective if it was tighter, focusing on the gondolas. Maybe crop horizontally a bit above the far left tail and vertically midway between the two rightmost tails. (I had to comment as I have nearly an identical shot from a trip a few years back. However, the lighting isn''t as nice on mine.)</td>', 'The lighting on this is excellent. I think the image would have been more effective if it was tighter, focusing on the gondolas. Maybe crop horizontally a bit above the far left tail and vertically midway between the two rightmost tails. (I had to comment as I have nearly an identical shot from a trip a few years back. However, the lighting isn''t as nice on mine.)', '2008-02-01 15:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447322, 637909, 37845, '<td valign="top">My favourite in this challenge. I hope you ribbon.</td>', 'My favourite in this challenge. I hope you ribbon.', '2008-02-01 15:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447323, 638931, 37845, '<td valign="top">Very well captured... one of the best in this challenge. I have your for red.</td>', 'Very well captured... one of the best in this challenge. I have your for red.', '2008-02-01 15:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447328, 639797, 37845, '<td valign="top">I love the black and white conversion here... I think you will ribbon.</td>', 'I love the black and white conversion here... I think you will ribbon.', '2008-02-01 15:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447904, 639432, 88926, '<td valign="top">Nice close up, I would like to see more of the camara in the shot.</td>', 'Nice close up, I would like to see more of the camara in the shot.', '2008-02-01 16:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447927, 638370, 88926, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of the camara and placement of the other items, but the focus is a little to soft.</td>', 'I like the angle of the camara and placement of the other items, but the focus is a little to soft.', '2008-02-01 16:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447986, 640075, 88926, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but find the shadows behind the stove distracting.</td>', 'I like the shot but find the shadows behind the stove distracting.', '2008-02-01 16:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448309, 638044, 88699, '<td valign="top">Awww!  I love it!</td>', 'Awww!  I love it!', '2008-02-01 18:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448359, 640064, 74015, '<td valign="top">Kinda strange that you have a snowman on the grass!</td>', 'Kinda strange that you have a snowman on the grass!', '2008-02-01 18:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448360, 639069, 74015, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit overexposed for me but I think this is a cool idea.</td>', 'Looks a bit overexposed for me but I think this is a cool idea.', '2008-02-01 18:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448365, 638329, 74015, '<td valign="top">the light effect has potential and I''d prefer if the cross was in focus.</td>', 'the light effect has potential and I''d prefer if the cross was in focus.', '2008-02-01 18:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448369, 639484, 74015, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but it is very cluttered. It''s hard for us to know what you wanted to focus on.</td>', 'Interesting idea but it is very cluttered. It''s hard for us to know what you wanted to focus on.', '2008-02-01 18:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448378, 638426, 74015, '<td valign="top">really nice colors and composition.</td>', 'really nice colors and composition.', '2008-02-01 18:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448383, 638814, 74015, '<td valign="top">really nice tool but I am not sure the reflection adds much.  Although I am sure it was not planned that way, the wounded nail gives a nice "reality touch".</td>', 'really nice tool but I am not sure the reflection adds much.  Although I am sure it was not planned that way, the wounded nail gives a nice "reality touch".', '2008-02-01 18:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448385, 639797, 74015, '<td valign="top">looks very surreal but I love the sky.  Makes me wonder what that building stands there for.</td>', 'looks very surreal but I love the sky.  Makes me wonder what that building stands there for.', '2008-02-01 18:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448388, 639999, 74015, '<td valign="top">not enough definition in the smoke part - had trouble seeing it and hence understanding your whole concept.  the lighting is nice though.</td>', 'not enough definition in the smoke part - had trouble seeing it and hence understanding your whole concept.  the lighting is nice though.', '2008-02-01 18:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448390, 639344, 74015, '<td valign="top">nice portrait but I think your subject deserved waiting for better light.</td>', 'nice portrait but I think your subject deserved waiting for better light.', '2008-02-01 18:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448395, 639859, 74015, '<td valign="top">love the POV and the idea - in these days of computer and internet, this is a great way of picturing the old way.</td>', 'love the POV and the idea - in these days of computer and internet, this is a great way of picturing the old way.', '2008-02-01 18:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448398, 639640, 74015, '<td valign="top">the focus should be on the violin, not on the shutters (?) in the back.</td>', 'the focus should be on the violin, not on the shutters (?) in the back.', '2008-02-01 18:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448404, 639912, 74015, '<td valign="top">if it was not for the earphones, this would look like a picture taken right out of the 70''s archive.  very effective PP on this.</td>', 'if it was not for the earphones, this would look like a picture taken right out of the 70''s archive.  very effective PP on this.', '2008-02-01 18:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448406, 639356, 74015, '<td valign="top">cool effect on the car</td>', 'cool effect on the car', '2008-02-01 18:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448412, 639697, 74015, '<td valign="top">if you were to do anything differently, I''d suggest painting the letter with a flashlight to anchor the viewer on it.  Right now, the candles steal the show.</td>', 'if you were to do anything differently, I''d suggest painting the letter with a flashlight to anchor the viewer on it.  Right now, the candles steal the show.', '2008-02-01 18:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448413, 637160, 74015, '<td valign="top">how does this fit the theme?  looks like a pretty new boat to me...</td>', 'how does this fit the theme?  looks like a pretty new boat to me...', '2008-02-01 18:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448419, 639464, 74015, '<td valign="top">cool desaturation, really fits the challenge.</td>', 'cool desaturation, really fits the challenge.', '2008-02-01 18:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448422, 638931, 74015, '<td valign="top">I really like the image - the lighting and composition are great.  Not sure if people will see this as fitting the challenge though.  They look pretty new and there are still a lot of Converse around...</td>', 'I really like the image - the lighting and composition are great.  Not sure if people will see this as fitting the challenge though.  They look pretty new and there are still a lot of Converse around...', '2008-02-01 18:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448424, 637421, 74015, '<td valign="top">the salt looks a little gray - maybe a bit underexposed??</td>', 'the salt looks a little gray - maybe a bit underexposed??', '2008-02-01 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448428, 638725, 74015, '<td valign="top">a simple subject that would need a boost in contrast to become a little more dramatic.</td>', 'a simple subject that would need a boost in contrast to become a little more dramatic.', '2008-02-01 18:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448430, 638850, 74015, '<td valign="top">what are the white streaks acros their bodies?  Looks kinda strange.</td>', 'what are the white streaks acros their bodies?  Looks kinda strange.', '2008-02-01 18:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448433, 638693, 74015, '<td valign="top">maybe a tighter crop to the right, to get rid of the empty expanse of water and help us focus more on the boats?  Love the sky!</td>', 'maybe a tighter crop to the right, to get rid of the empty expanse of water and help us focus more on the boats?  Love the sky!', '2008-02-01 18:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448435, 637203, 74015, '<td valign="top">WOW!  So dramatic!</td>', 'WOW!  So dramatic!', '2008-02-01 18:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448442, 637986, 74015, '<td valign="top">not sure about the very centered composition - makes it a bit boring...  good exposure job though.</td>', 'not sure about the very centered composition - makes it a bit boring...  good exposure job though.', '2008-02-01 18:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448448, 638593, 74015, '<td valign="top">Aaaawwwww!!  look at that cute little belly!!  Wish the ears of the adult were not cut off but a great capture anyway!</td>', 'Aaaawwwww!!  look at that cute little belly!!  Wish the ears of the adult were not cut off but a great capture anyway!', '2008-02-01 18:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448450, 637753, 74015, '<td valign="top">Great subject, very fitting for the challenge.  I think the orange tone of the sepia is a tad too strong IMO.</td>', 'Great subject, very fitting for the challenge.  I think the orange tone of the sepia is a tad too strong IMO.', '2008-02-01 18:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448454, 639641, 74015, '<td valign="top">we''ve seen the almost exact same shot of violin in front of shutters and both of them are badly OOF.</td>', 'we''ve seen the almost exact same shot of violin in front of shutters and both of them are badly OOF.', '2008-02-01 18:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448455, 639751, 74015, '<td valign="top">Cool and sharp image that would look very good in B&amp;W.  The noise you got from sharpening the image would become lovely grain in B&amp;W and would enhance the "oldness" of your subject.</td>', 'Cool and sharp image that would look very good in B&W.  The noise you got from sharpening the image would become lovely grain in B&W and would enhance the "oldness" of your subject.', '2008-02-01 18:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448460, 639795, 74015, '<td valign="top">that''s a cool idea but I think there is too much stuff to look at. My eye doesn''t know where to rest - there''s no real focus.  The tones you worked are fantastic.</td>', 'that''s a cool idea but I think there is too much stuff to look at. My eye doesn''t know where to rest - there''s no real focus.  The tones you worked are fantastic.', '2008-02-01 18:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448465, 639788, 74015, '<td valign="top">the border really doesn''t do anything for me - the fact that it is in color only detracts from the rest of the image.</td>', 'the border really doesn''t do anything for me - the fact that it is in color only detracts from the rest of the image.', '2008-02-01 18:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448469, 639606, 74015, '<td valign="top">lovely candle-lit portrait, the exposure is spot-on, a 9 IMO.</td>', 'lovely candle-lit portrait, the exposure is spot-on, a 9 IMO.', '2008-02-01 18:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448474, 638429, 74015, '<td valign="top">OMG!  I love this!  What he is blowing in?  And the border is just right for the image.  My best so far!</td>', 'OMG!  I love this!  What he is blowing in?  And the border is just right for the image.  My best so far!', '2008-02-01 19:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448489, 639871, 74015, '<td valign="top">love the long shadows and the contrast of the dark brick wall with the smooth white wall.  A great shot IMO.</td>', 'love the long shadows and the contrast of the dark brick wall with the smooth white wall.  A great shot IMO.', '2008-02-01 19:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448494, 638056, 74015, '<td valign="top">What an amazing sky!!!</td>', 'What an amazing sky!!!', '2008-02-01 19:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448498, 639809, 74015, '<td valign="top">Ooooh this is so cool!  Your choice of DOF is just perfect.  Hope you will tell the story behind this picture in your comment.  This is my winner - I hope you ribbon with this!</td>', 'Ooooh this is so cool!  Your choice of DOF is just perfect.  Hope you will tell the story behind this picture in your comment.  This is my winner - I hope you ribbon with this!', '2008-02-01 19:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448506, 639654, 73344, '<td valign="top">Love the subject, and the color :D</td>', 'Love the subject, and the color :D', '2008-02-01 19:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448507, 638898, 73344, '<td valign="top">LOVE the colors of this, just superb.</td>', 'LOVE the colors of this, just superb.', '2008-02-01 19:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
