(4448597, 639934, 73344, '<td valign="top">Wow, great use of lines, love this (it couldn''t fit into the architecture challenge too ;) lol...good job!</td>', 'Wow, great use of lines, love this (it couldn''t fit into the architecture challenge too ;) lol...good job!', '2008-02-01 19:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448825, 639484, 83313, '<td valign="top">Resistance is futile! Sorry, really bad electronics pun there, but I had to do it or I would burst.<br/> <br/>A lot of fascinating detail in this shot, and it certainly fit the theme, but as artistic photography, It''s just a snapshot. I''m afraid I don''t see any real composition to it. My eye just wanders around the frame.</td>', 'Resistance is futile! Sorry, really bad electronics pun there, but I had to do it or I would burst. A lot of fascinating detail in this shot, and it certainly fit the theme, but as artistic photography, It''s just a snapshot. I''m afraid I don''t see any real composition to it. My eye just wanders around the frame.', '2008-02-01 21:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448841, 639657, 83313, '<td valign="top">I have not worn a watch in at least 10 years. The Air Force trained me to always remove watches, rings and jewelery when working on electrical equipment, so it''s just something else in my pocket all day. Besides, I always have something else with the time on it. I''m sure I am not the only one that has stopped wearing a watch, and that''s why I find your entry quite appropriate for this challenge.<br/> <br/>The composition here tries to lead the eye, except for the brightness over on the right being a distraction.  There''s not a lot of wow to it, I''m afraid, and the image needs some skew correction.<br/> <br/>Getting closer to the watch and showing some of it''s detail may have helped.</td>', 'I have not worn a watch in at least 10 years. The Air Force trained me to always remove watches, rings and jewelery when working on electrical equipment, so it''s just something else in my pocket all day. Besides, I always have something else with the time on it. I''m sure I am not the only one that has stopped wearing a watch, and that''s why I find your entry quite appropriate for this challenge. The composition here tries to lead the eye, except for the brightness over on the right being a distraction.  There''s not a lot of wow to it, I''m afraid, and the image needs some skew correction. Getting closer to the watch and showing some of it''s detail may have helped.', '2008-02-01 21:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4449085, 640062, 88825, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. Good concept and nice lighting!</td>', 'I like this shot. Good concept and nice lighting!', '2008-02-01 22:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4449087, 639782, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see some potential in this shot. The scene itself is a good one, however, the contrast is dull and there are some purple streaks going through it. Not sure what caused it. Perhaps it may be from adjustments needed to bring out the details from the dark areas?</td>', 'I see some potential in this shot. The scene itself is a good one, however, the contrast is dull and there are some purple streaks going through it. Not sure what caused it. Perhaps it may be from adjustments needed to bring out the details from the dark areas?', '2008-02-01 22:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
