(4451251, 638071, 88054, '<td valign="top">Love the photo. Image is too small. Use your editing software (Photoshop) go to image...image size. select 640 pixels (basic challenge) Then save for web (150KB). That will give you the largest allowable image. Nice photo.</td>', 'Love the photo. Image is too small. Use your editing software (Photoshop) go to image...image size. select 640 pixels (basic challenge) Then save for web (150KB). That will give you the largest allowable image. Nice photo.', '2008-02-02 16:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
