(4451908, 639732, 89763, '<td valign="top">I love the use of B&amp;W for the "olden" effect. The "bug" adds to this feeling, as well as the guy on that bicycle contraption, of course!</td>', 'I love the use of B&W for the "olden" effect. The "bug" adds to this feeling, as well as the guy on that bicycle contraption, of course!', '2008-02-02 20:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
