(4451910, 639657, 89763, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition of the digital versus analog timepieces. I''d like to see more dof.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition of the digital versus analog timepieces. I''d like to see more dof.', '2008-02-02 20:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
