(4454285, 637753, 68035, '<td valign="top">Taken outside the realm of the ''standard'' old car shot by the fact that you have incorporated such a dilapidated looking fuel pump (is it really working?)<br/> <br/>Great use of sepia as well</td>', 'Taken outside the realm of the ''standard'' old car shot by the fact that you have incorporated such a dilapidated looking fuel pump (is it really working?) Great use of sepia as well', '2008-02-03 16:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
