(4454297, 640019, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oooo I bet it was a tough call whether to entre this shot in the architecture or old ways challenge, because it fis both wonderfully.  I love the addition of the girl running across the lawn which adds to a superb sense of isolation in the image (and makes me think of the film the Last Emporer)<br/> <br/>Breathtaking</td>', 'Oooo I bet it was a tough call whether to entre this shot in the architecture or old ways challenge, because it fis both wonderfully.  I love the addition of the girl running across the lawn which adds to a superb sense of isolation in the image (and makes me think of the film the Last Emporer) Breathtaking', '2008-02-03 16:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454307, 639934, 87424, '<td valign="top">Compositon, texture, and contrast is executed very well.  8</td>', 'Compositon, texture, and contrast is executed very well.  8', '2008-02-03 16:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454312, 638658, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great image of a craftsman at work and one that both fits the challenge well and but also stands alone as an excellent image.  I love the accentuated blur on the hands (although for some reason I find the very very slight blur of his head a little distracting.  A suer shot though and bumping to 9</td>', 'Great image of a craftsman at work and one that both fits the challenge well and but also stands alone as an excellent image.  I love the accentuated blur on the hands (although for some reason I find the very very slight blur of his head a little distracting.  A suer shot though and bumping to 9', '2008-02-03 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454323, 639565, 87424, '<td valign="top">Intresting shot, the green seems a bit over processed. 6</td>', 'Intresting shot, the green seems a bit over processed. 6', '2008-02-03 16:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454328, 640028, 68035, '<td valign="top">My favourite non black and white shot in the challenge which really does capture the spirit of the competition.  Great sharpness (excuse the pun), perhaps would have scored better if the tapestry had been of purely complimentary colours, but I have to say I perfer it like this as the viewer gets the feeling that they are looking at something that is real and not just staged for a photo.  8 from me</td>', 'My favourite non black and white shot in the challenge which really does capture the spirit of the competition.  Great sharpness (excuse the pun), perhaps would have scored better if the tapestry had been of purely complimentary colours, but I have to say I perfer it like this as the viewer gets the feeling that they are looking at something that is real and not just staged for a photo.  8 from me', '2008-02-03 16:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454346, 639797, 87424, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Brillianlty rich.  Feels Cold.9</td>', 'Love it.  Brillianlty rich.  Feels Cold.9', '2008-02-03 16:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
