(4455536, 639788, 82534, '<td valign="top">It''s like my grandpa''s shed!  Scary -- that''s for sure.  Regarding the photo, I like it all except the frame -- but that''s a matter of personal taste I guess.</td>', 'It''s like my grandpa''s shed!  Scary -- that''s for sure.  Regarding the photo, I like it all except the frame -- but that''s a matter of personal taste I guess.', '2008-02-03 22:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
