(4455609, 637830, 87860, '<td valign="top">nice set up</td>', 'nice set up', '2008-02-03 23:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456110, 638931, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  It makes me smile :)   I do wish the border was the same color as the shoes, though, and not green.  Just a minor nit pick.  I like the selective desat here.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  It makes me smile :)   I do wish the border was the same color as the shoes, though, and not green.  Just a minor nit pick.  I like the selective desat here.', '2008-02-04 01:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456400, 637203, 39430, '<td valign="top">The subject is lost in the background.  I''d like to see more light on the subject, and the background less exposed.  Nice use of DOF.</td>', 'The subject is lost in the background.  I''d like to see more light on the subject, and the background less exposed.  Nice use of DOF.', '2008-02-04 07:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456404, 639667, 39430, '<td valign="top">The sepia colour is a bit too yellow.  I think this photo would really benefit from somebody in period costume standing somewhere on the machine to show the scale - assuming it''s not a really tiny model.  :)</td>', 'The sepia colour is a bit too yellow.  I think this photo would really benefit from somebody in period costume standing somewhere on the machine to show the scale - assuming it''s not a really tiny model.  :)', '2008-02-04 07:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456407, 638480, 39430, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to work out what this was.  Scary to think the younger voters might never have seen one!  Nice abstract, but perhaps a little too abstract to score well.</td>', 'It took me a while to work out what this was.  Scary to think the younger voters might never have seen one!  Nice abstract, but perhaps a little too abstract to score well.', '2008-02-04 07:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456408, 639640, 39430, '<td valign="top">Focus is not so good.  While the lines are nice for the composition, I do think the ''garage-door'' background detracts from the image.</td>', 'Focus is not so good.  While the lines are nice for the composition, I do think the ''garage-door'' background detracts from the image.', '2008-02-04 07:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456411, 639383, 39430, '<td valign="top">Lovely woodwork, and the silhouetted bars work well.  I can''t stop wishing the lighting was better, but I can''t think what to suggest.</td>', 'Lovely woodwork, and the silhouetted bars work well.  I can''t stop wishing the lighting was better, but I can''t think what to suggest.', '2008-02-04 07:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456413, 639657, 39430, '<td valign="top">The orange tone here is a little too string.  I like the shallow DOF - could be better even shallower.</td>', 'The orange tone here is a little too string.  I like the shallow DOF - could be better even shallower.', '2008-02-04 07:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456414, 639651, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very busy for a BW image, but I think this is something a lot of older voters will remember well.</td>', 'Very busy for a BW image, but I think this is something a lot of older voters will remember well.', '2008-02-04 07:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456417, 639589, 39430, '<td valign="top">White balance is a little too blue here.  You can use Shade or Cloudy WB, even in full sun, to warm up the colours a little.</td>', 'White balance is a little too blue here.  You can use Shade or Cloudy WB, even in full sun, to warm up the colours a little.', '2008-02-04 07:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456418, 638044, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, and nice concept.</td>', 'I like the lighting, and nice concept.', '2008-02-04 07:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456419, 639926, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not quite sharp.  I like the lines of the fence.</td>', 'Not quite sharp.  I like the lines of the fence.', '2008-02-04 07:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456421, 639782, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is just calling out for some dual-exposure HDR!  Nice rustic scene, but the noisy photo lets it down.</td>', 'This is just calling out for some dual-exposure HDR!  Nice rustic scene, but the noisy photo lets it down.', '2008-02-04 07:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456422, 639697, 39430, '<td valign="top">With the addition of a spotlight on the letter and quill, this would be a great shot.</td>', 'With the addition of a spotlight on the letter and quill, this would be a great shot.', '2008-02-04 07:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456425, 638727, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice bright shot, although a little too oversharpened, and looks like jpg compression artifacts.</td>', 'Nice bright shot, although a little too oversharpened, and looks like jpg compression artifacts.', '2008-02-04 07:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456427, 640050, 39430, '<td valign="top">I quite like the skewed frame, as it adds a little quirkiness to the image.  However, this frame will be risky with the voters.  A little USM wouldn''t go astray to crisp up this shot.</td>', 'I quite like the skewed frame, as it adds a little quirkiness to the image.  However, this frame will be risky with the voters.  A little USM wouldn''t go astray to crisp up this shot.', '2008-02-04 07:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456432, 639239, 39430, '<td valign="top">The background doesn''t work so well for me.  I know it''s meant to be a discarded bike, but it kind of disappears in the busy background.</td>', 'The background doesn''t work so well for me.  I know it''s meant to be a discarded bike, but it kind of disappears in the busy background.', '2008-02-04 07:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456436, 638045, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, and great character.  I''m not sure whether the full sun is the best lighting here, but you probably didn''t have much say in that.  A sunset shot of this same location might be really cool too.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice colours, and great character.  I''m not sure whether the full sun is the best lighting here, but you probably didn''t have much say in that.  A sunset shot of this same location might be really cool too.  Well done.', '2008-02-04 07:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456438, 640003, 39430, '<td valign="top">Aha, finally.  Nice colours, great compositional lines.  My only gripe is the blown out lamps, but that would take exposure bracketing to fix, and you can''t do that in basic.</td>', 'Aha, finally.  Nice colours, great compositional lines.  My only gripe is the blown out lamps, but that would take exposure bracketing to fix, and you can''t do that in basic.', '2008-02-04 07:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456441, 638757, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle colours.  A little more contrast would help define the image better.</td>', 'Nice subtle colours.  A little more contrast would help define the image better.', '2008-02-04 07:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456442, 639793, 39430, '<td valign="top">Too high contrast for me, but a great location for a shot!</td>', 'Too high contrast for me, but a great location for a shot!', '2008-02-04 07:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456446, 639344, 39430, '<td valign="top">Somehow, he looks too happy.  Cowboys are supposed to be tired, sore and dusty.  :)  But a nice portrait.  A wider aperture giving a bit of background blur would improve the seperation of subject from background.</td>', 'Somehow, he looks too happy.  Cowboys are supposed to be tired, sore and dusty.  :)  But a nice portrait.  A wider aperture giving a bit of background blur would improve the seperation of subject from background.', '2008-02-04 07:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456451, 640038, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and colouring.  A bit of film-grain or noise would actually help this image.  I know you can''t do it in basic editing, but you should make another edit for your portfolio with a slight grungy texture overlay to give it some real old-photo character.</td>', 'Nice setup and colouring.  A bit of film-grain or noise would actually help this image.  I know you can''t do it in basic editing, but you should make another edit for your portfolio with a slight grungy texture overlay to give it some real old-photo character.', '2008-02-04 07:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456453, 640037, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow, he looks sad.  Those eyes are spooky!</td>', 'Wow, he looks sad.  Those eyes are spooky!', '2008-02-04 07:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456455, 639606, 39430, '<td valign="top">Just the right exposure.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Just the right exposure.  Nicely done.', '2008-02-04 07:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456457, 639646, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and colours.  The sky is a little blown out in the background.  This can sometimes be improved by shooting away from the sun, or using a polariser to darken the blue sky.</td>', 'Nice lines and colours.  The sky is a little blown out in the background.  This can sometimes be improved by shooting away from the sun, or using a polariser to darken the blue sky.', '2008-02-04 07:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456460, 638658, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Having a person in the image gives it so much more character.  What he''s actually doing is lost in the motion blur, but that helps to focus the viewer to think about it.</td>', 'Very nice.  Having a person in the image gives it so much more character.  What he''s actually doing is lost in the motion blur, but that helps to focus the viewer to think about it.', '2008-02-04 07:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456463, 639788, 39430, '<td valign="top">Oooh, you are gonna get hammered for the frame, I think.  :)  Other than that, this is a nice BW image, and the flame, oh, I mean frame does actually hamek the image stand out without detracting too much.</td>', 'Oooh, you are gonna get hammered for the frame, I think.  :)  Other than that, this is a nice BW image, and the flame, oh, I mean frame does actually hamek the image stand out without detracting too much.', '2008-02-04 07:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456465, 639975, 39430, '<td valign="top">I can''t help wondering how long before somebody gets electrocuted here.  :P</td>', 'I can''t help wondering how long before somebody gets electrocuted here.  :P', '2008-02-04 07:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456468, 639351, 39430, '<td valign="top">A little extra colour saturation could help here to bring out the pipes.  Leave the blues though.</td>', 'A little extra colour saturation could help here to bring out the pipes.  Leave the blues though.', '2008-02-04 07:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456470, 639859, 39430, '<td valign="top">Just a touch of colour somewhere would add to this image I think.  Even a reflection of a little colour in the pen nib.</td>', 'Just a touch of colour somewhere would add to this image I think.  Even a reflection of a little colour in the pen nib.', '2008-02-04 07:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456474, 639610, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice smoke.  Not quite focused right.  Ideally, the end of the cig would be in focus, and a little behind.  Man, smoking is horrible.  I can almost smell this photo.  ;)</td>', 'Nice smoke.  Not quite focused right.  Ideally, the end of the cig would be in focus, and a little behind.  Man, smoking is horrible.  I can almost smell this photo.  ;)', '2008-02-04 07:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456485, 639252, 39430, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of good points and bad.  This is a great location, with this fantastic decaying old building, and the girl is a great addition to humanise the scene.  But, the powerlines and the lighting and sky colouring all let it down.</td>', 'This image has a lot of good points and bad.  This is a great location, with this fantastic decaying old building, and the girl is a great addition to humanise the scene.  But, the powerlines and the lighting and sky colouring all let it down.', '2008-02-04 07:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456487, 639128, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice lineup, although I think you pushed the saturation just a touch too far.</td>', 'Nice lineup, although I think you pushed the saturation just a touch too far.', '2008-02-04 07:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456491, 639560, 39430, '<td valign="top">The close-crop and centred composition don''t really add much to the image.  The background building doesn''t look too modern, so you could probably have included more of it as a background to support the subject.</td>', 'The close-crop and centred composition don''t really add much to the image.  The background building doesn''t look too modern, so you could probably have included more of it as a background to support the subject.', '2008-02-04 07:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456495, 639483, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like the motion-blur.  A little USM would help to crisp up the sharpening.</td>', 'I like the motion-blur.  A little USM would help to crisp up the sharpening.', '2008-02-04 07:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456496, 637753, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, although I''m not real keen on the pink colouring</td>', 'Nice shot, although I''m not real keen on the pink colouring', '2008-02-04 07:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
