(4458016, 639252, 61961, '<td valign="top">What a great old entrance, and I like the concept of the girl in front, but technically there are some problems: it''s not very sharp, the girl sort of disappears against the background, the upper left corner is too bright and draws the eye away from the subjects, a lot of empty space down front, plus you''ve got the phone wires.  Maybe shot at a later time of afternoon, with a tripod and a reflector or fill flash, would bring better results (though no recommendation for the wires, unless you can cut them down). ;-)</td>', 'What a great old entrance, and I like the concept of the girl in front, but technically there are some problems: it''s not very sharp, the girl sort of disappears against the background, the upper left corner is too bright and draws the eye away from the subjects, a lot of empty space down front, plus you''ve got the phone wires.  Maybe shot at a later time of afternoon, with a tripod and a reflector or fill flash, would bring better results (though no recommendation for the wires, unless you can cut them down). ;-)', '2008-02-04 17:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4458123, 640077, 89420, '<td valign="top">Nice use of Sepia and cool idea</td>', 'Nice use of Sepia and cool idea', '2008-02-04 18:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4458128, 639859, 89420, '<td valign="top">NIce simple picture. It could have been cooler if you could have captured the pen while its writing.</td>', 'NIce simple picture. It could have been cooler if you could have captured the pen while its writing.', '2008-02-04 18:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4458135, 638044, 89420, '<td valign="top">Too bad the film is exposed. but cool ideah abou the heart film.</td>', 'Too bad the film is exposed. but cool ideah abou the heart film.', '2008-02-04 18:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4458137, 639795, 89420, '<td valign="top">Nice old hand tools although most of those are still used today. i like how there''s a shadow on the wood.</td>', 'Nice old hand tools although most of those are still used today. i like how there''s a shadow on the wood.', '2008-02-04 18:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
