(4464041, 640041, 62357, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote (or honestly even scan) this challenge, but this is clever.  Funny how many people didn''t get it!  Have you tried the Alien Skin Exposure plug-in?  This is great for mimicking the various film types. I am trying them all out in the B&amp;W side challenge. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=641088" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62357/120/641088.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62357/120/641088.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62357/120/641088.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I didn''t vote (or honestly even scan) this challenge, but this is clever.  Funny how many people didn''t get it!  Have you tried the Alien Skin Exposure plug-in?  This is great for mimicking the various film types. I am trying them all out in the B&W side challenge.  ', '2008-02-06 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 0),
