(4465428, 638388, 88962, '<td valign="top">To start off with, I really appreciate everyone who commented my photo. They were very inspiring and a great source of encouragement. <br/>As you can tell by my stats, I am just a beginner and new to this site. It is a great privilege to be counted in the top ten with so many professionals entering the challenges. Hope to continue to do just as well if not better in the upcoming challenges, as i still have a lot to learn. It is an honor to be included in the top ten, I thought that this picture would do well but didn''t think it would make it into the top ten. Thanks again to everyone who voted and commented.   <br/></td>', 'To start off with, I really appreciate everyone who commented my photo. They were very inspiring and a great source of encouragement. As you can tell by my stats, I am just a beginner and new to this site. It is a great privilege to be counted in the top ten with so many professionals entering the challenges. Hope to continue to do just as well if not better in the upcoming challenges, as i still have a lot to learn. It is an honor to be included in the top ten, I thought that this picture would do well but didn''t think it would make it into the top ten. Thanks again to everyone who voted and commented.   ', '2008-02-06 16:49:54.000000', NULL, 0),
