(4466252, 639809, 51538, '<td valign="top">Jason, with a Dad like that I bet you have some great photos in stock... and sausage too.  I''ve never tried that type, but it sounds pretty tasty.  Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'Jason, with a Dad like that I bet you have some great photos in stock... and sausage too.  I''ve never tried that type, but it sounds pretty tasty.  Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2008-02-06 20:57:16.000000', NULL, 0),
